      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York has responsibility to provide medical, behavioral health, dental and associated social work services for inmates and detainees of correctional facilities maintained and operated by the City as well as the infant children residing with their mothers in such facilities (\"Correctional Health Services\"); and",
