        1564,
        1568
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, under the terms of a Memorandum of Understanding to be entered by and among the City of New York, DOHMH, the Department of Correction and the New York City Health and Hospitals Corporation (\"HHC\") relating to the provision of Correctional Health Services, and the terms of a Memorandum of Understanding to be entered by and among the City of New York, DOHMH and HHC relating to certain Correctional Health Services that are funded by certain grants, HHC will assume responsibility for the provision of Correctional Health Services;",
